		{"id":"g3","type":"text","text":"**Gap.** Shoot a grader trim pass. Interim: Jon's p.5 grader still with a crossfall line, or a crossfall diagram (water runs off vs ponds). No AI shot in a method beat.\n[[Script & Storyboard]] · [[Remotion Build Notes]]","x":840,"y":260,"width":360,"height":135,"color":"1"},
